This project downloads and derives data from the Amazon Shopping Queries
(ESCI) dataset, which is NOT distributed with this repository:

  Shopping Queries Dataset: A Large-Scale ESCI Benchmark for Improving
  Product Search
  https://github.com/amazon-science/esci-data
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

  Citation:
  Reddy, C. K., Marquez, L., Valero, F., Rao, N., Zaragoza, H.,
  Bandyopadhyay, S., Biswas, A., Xing, A., Subbian, K. (2022).
  Shopping Queries Dataset: A Large-Scale ESCI Benchmark for Improving
  Product Search. arXiv:2206.06588.

Derived artifacts in this project (the loaded product catalog, judgment
files such as data/esci_*.json, and the published evaluation results in
docs/results/) are derived from that dataset and carry the same
Apache-2.0 attribution. Prices and stock values are synthetic and are
not part of the original dataset.

The product pictures in assets/products/ were generated for this sample with
Stability AI Stable Image Core on Amazon Bedrock, from product titles. They
are illustrations, not photographs of the products. Check the terms for
generated output (see docs/generative-ai.md).
